## What this project is

**{{projectName}}** is a full-stack web application scaffolded by [`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude)
using the `react-django` stack:

| Layer    | Technology                                             |
|----------|--------------------------------------------------------|
| Frontend | React 19, Vite, TypeScript (strict)                    |
| Backend  | Django 5, Django REST Framework, drf-spectacular, uv   |
{{#if withPostgres}}
| Database | PostgreSQL (Django migrations)                         |
{{else}}
| Database | SQLite in dev (Django migrations)                      |
{{/if}}
{{#if withS3}}
| Storage  | S3 via django-storages/boto3 (MinIO locally)           |
{{/if}}
{{#if withCelery}}
| Async    | Celery + Redis{{#if withCeleryBeat}} + Celery Beat{{/if}} (Flower monitor)          |
{{/if}}
| Infra    | Docker Compose (single `docker-compose.yml`)           |
| Testing  | pytest + pytest-django · Playwright + Cucumber (e2e)   |
| Security | Bandit · Semgrep · Trivy (all via Docker)              |

