## Development workflows

### Start the stack (Docker)

```bash
dude up --build   # first time (migrations run automatically on boot)
dude up           # subsequent runs
dude db superuser # optional: admin account for /admin/
```

### Local development (no Docker)

```bash
# Backend (terminal 1)
cd backend
uv sync
uv run python manage.py migrate
uv run python manage.py runserver      # http://localhost:8000

# Frontend (terminal 2)
cd frontend
pnpm install
pnpm dev                               # http://localhost:5173
```

### After changing backend endpoints

```bash
dude api sync      # regenerate the typed client from /api/schema/
dude api review    # sanity-check the generated output
```

### After changing models

```bash
dude db makemigration --app <app>   # generate the migration — always commit it
dude db migrate
```

